# Clips: MLT (the engine behind Kdenlive and Shotcut) for the viewer and for making the video; frei0r for laying
# video tracks over one another. ffmpeg (already in) makes thumbnails, waveforms, proxies and scopes.
melt
python3-mlt
libmlt-data
frei0r-plugins
# Steadying shaky footage uses ffmpeg's vid.stab filters (Ubuntu's ffmpeg is built with them).
# Speech to captions uses whisper.cpp or faster-whisper when they're installed (not shipped: the models are large).
